# Blind listening audio is a regenerable COPY of the arm_*/ wavs (build_listen_page.py).
# key.json is NOT ignored: exported listening scores are token-keyed and only that
# file maps a token back to an arm, so regenerating would orphan the scores.
eval/results/urdu_bakeoff/blind/

# Real recorded human voice, deliberately untracked: the LoRA POC training
# clips and the second speaker reference. Same reasoning as backend/data/ --
# real people's voice data does not belong in a shared repo. Swept in once by
# an over-broad `git add -A eval/` (2026-08-16); ignored so it cannot recur.
eval/training/
eval/fixtures/voice_urdu_female.wav

# Exported YouTube cookies — session secrets, never commit
yt-cookies.txt
*cookies*.txt
